invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Client.toCfg drops the values' ticket when takes_tickets is
  false. A client that keeps no new tickets then cannot resume the ticket
  it offers: a TRUST=webpki client runs a full handshake, and a raw or ca
  client sets no key and init refuses it. Both loops resume a ticket
  with takes_tickets false, and object.

--- old
        if (values.ticket) |ticket| {
--- new
        if (if (values.takes_tickets) values.ticket else null) |ticket| {
